    "type": "question",
    "label": "20",
    "prompt": "If $7\\times{}^{2n}P_n=4\\times{}^{2n+1}P_n$, find $n$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$n=3$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}7\\times\\frac{(2n)!}{n!}&=4\\times\\frac{(2n+1)!}{(n+1)!}\\\\7\\times\\frac{(2n)!}{n!}&=4\\times\\frac{(2n+1)(2n)!}{(n+1)n!}\\end{align*}$$\nDivide both sides by $\\dfrac{(2n)!}{n!}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}7&=\\frac{4(2n+1)}{n+1}\\\\7(n+1)&=4(2n+1)\\\\7n+7&=8n+4\\\\3&=n\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
